@startuml View Order History Sequence Diagram

!theme plain
title View Order History Use Case\n(צפייה בהיסטוריית הזמנות)

actor "User\n(משתמש)" as User
participant "Dashboard Page\n(עמוד לוח בקרה)" as DashboardPage
participant "Orders Component\n(רכיב הזמנות)" as OrdersComponent
participant "Order Reducer\n(Redux)" as OrderReducer
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Order Controller" as OrderController
participant "Customer Order Model\n(MongoDB)" as CustomerOrderModel
participant "Auth Order Model\n(MongoDB)" as AuthOrderModel

User -> DashboardPage: Navigate to user dashboard\n(מעבר ללוח בקרה של המשתמש)
activate DashboardPage

DashboardPage -> DashboardPage: Check user authentication\n(בדיקת אימות משתמש)

User -> DashboardPage: Click "My Orders" tab\n(לחיצה על לשונית "ההזמנות שלי")

DashboardPage -> OrdersComponent: Load Orders component\n(טעינת רכיב הזמנות)
activate OrdersComponent

OrdersComponent -> OrdersComponent: Get userId from auth state\n(קבלת מזהה משתמש ממצב האימות)

OrdersComponent -> OrderReducer: dispatch(get_orders(userId, status))
activate OrderReducer

OrderReducer -> API: GET /api/home/customer/get-orders/:customerId/:status
activate API

API -> OrderController: get_orders(req, res)
activate OrderController

OrderController -> OrderController: Extract customerId and status\nfrom request parameters\n(חילוץ מזהה לקוח וסטטוס מפרמטרי הבקשה)

OrderController -> OrderController: Convert customerId to ObjectId\n(המרת מזהה לקוח ל-ObjectId)

OrderController -> CustomerOrderModel: find({customerId}).sort({createdAt: -1})
activate CustomerOrderModel
CustomerOrderModel --> OrderController: Customer orders list\n(רשימת הזמנות לקוח)
deactivate CustomerOrderModel

OrderController -> OrderController: Filter orders by status if specified:\n- 'pending'\n- 'processing' \n- 'warehouse'\n- 'placed'\n- 'cancelled'\n(סינון הזמנות לפי סטטוס)

OrderController --> API: 200 - Orders list with details
deactivate OrderController

API --> OrderReducer: Success response with orders
deactivate API

OrderReducer -> OrderReducer: Update orders state:\n- myOrders array\n- Order counts by status\n(עדכון מצב הזמנות)

OrderReducer --> OrdersComponent: Orders data updated
deactivate OrderReducer

OrdersComponent -> OrdersComponent: Render orders list:\n- Order ID and date\n- Products summary\n- Total amount\n- Payment status\n- Delivery status\n(הצגת רשימת הזמנות)

OrdersComponent --> User: Display order history\n(הצגת היסטוריית הזמנות)

alt User wants to view order details
    User -> OrdersComponent: Click on specific order\n(לחיצה על הזמנה ספציפית)
    
    OrdersComponent -> OrderReducer: dispatch(get_order_details(orderId))
    activate OrderReducer
    
    OrderReducer -> API: GET /api/home/customer/get-order-details/:orderId
    activate API
    
    API -> OrderController: get_order_details(req, res)
    activate OrderController
    
    OrderController -> CustomerOrderModel: findById(orderId).populate('products')
    activate CustomerOrderModel
    CustomerOrderModel --> OrderController: Detailed order information\n(מידע מפורט על ההזמנה)
    deactivate CustomerOrderModel
    
    OrderController -> AuthOrderModel: find({orderId}).populate('sellerId')
    activate AuthOrderModel
    AuthOrderModel --> OrderController: Seller-specific order details\n(פרטי הזמנה ספציפיים למוכר)
    deactivate AuthOrderModel
    
    OrderController --> API: 200 - Detailed order information
    deactivate OrderController
    
    API --> OrderReducer: Success response with order details
    deactivate API
    
    OrderReducer -> OrderReducer: Update order details state\n(עדכון מצב פרטי הזמנה)
    
    OrderReducer --> OrdersComponent: Order details updated
    deactivate OrderReducer
    
    OrdersComponent -> OrdersComponent: Navigate to OrderDetails component\n(מעבר לרכיב פרטי הזמנה)
    
    OrdersComponent --> User: Display detailed order view:\n- Complete product list\n- Shipping information\n- Payment details\n- Tracking information\n(הצגת תצוגה מפורטת של ההזמנה)
end

alt User wants to filter orders
    User -> OrdersComponent: Select order status filter\n(בחירת מסנן סטטוס הזמנה)
    
    OrdersComponent -> OrderReducer: dispatch(get_orders(userId, selectedStatus))
    activate OrderReducer
    
    OrderReducer -> API: GET /api/home/customer/get-orders/:customerId/:status
    activate API
    
    API -> OrderController: get_orders with status filter
    activate OrderController
    
    OrderController -> CustomerOrderModel: find({customerId, delivery_status: status})
    activate CustomerOrderModel
    CustomerOrderModel --> OrderController: Filtered orders\n(הזמנות מסוננות)
    deactivate CustomerOrderModel
    
    OrderController --> API: 200 - Filtered orders list
    deactivate OrderController
    
    API --> OrderReducer: Success response
    deactivate API
    
    OrderReducer --> OrdersComponent: Filtered orders displayed
    deactivate OrderReducer
    
    OrdersComponent --> User: Show filtered results\n(הצגת תוצאות מסוננות)
end

deactivate OrdersComponent
deactivate DashboardPage

@enduml
